{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1044,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1914556,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":287239,"Name":"GrahamCrackerLackin","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1466939278,"LastPoster":{"Id":281378,"Name":"cruisebride2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":88,"Preview":{"Id":1914956,"PostDate":1469055461,"PostContent":"@GrahamCrackerLackin- Welcome to the boards! I got married in Jamaica during a cruise on Royal Ca...","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10743;484\/st\/20160413\/e\/Wedding+Day\/k\/c760\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"lm_sprowl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.26.164.62","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418257431,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cruisebride2016","Id":281378,"Name":"cruisebride2016","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.19.231.4","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80154,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"daf13a71a7ce892eb5795b7b0928c186","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey all!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is my first time posting on this board and I am planning on a 2017 Carnival Cruise Wedding.\n\nI really like the low stress idea, where there&#039;s no having to deal with clean up or set up, its just one big party!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am nervous about how everyone else will react to the news, my mom and sister love the idea but I don&#039;t want the rest of my family to roll their eyes and say &#039; we have to PAY to come to your wedding?&#039;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How did your families react when you told them the news? Did you get any bad reactions?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914556,"PostDate":1466939278,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey all!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is my first time posting on this board and I am planning on a 2017 Carnival Cruise Wedding.<br>\nI really like the low stress idea, where there's no having to deal with clean up or set up, its just one big party!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am nervous about how everyone else will react to the news, my mom and sister love the idea but I don't want the rest of my family to roll their eyes and say ' we have to PAY to come to your wedding?'.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How did your families react when you told them the news? Did you get any bad reactions?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christinegburke@ymail.com","IpAddress":"206.19.231.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1466932276,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"GrahamCrackerLackin","Id":287239,"Name":"GrahamCrackerLackin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.61.107.139","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80154,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9311e28fcad7ab8867c9c055f2c593ab","RawContent":"I&#039;m not doing a cruise wedding but our family and friends are either totally for or totally not feeling our decision to have a destination wedding. The ones who are coming are super excited though and everyone has been supportive as far as saying we should just do what makes us happy.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914566,"PostDate":1467067301,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm not doing a cruise wedding but our family and friends are either totally for or totally not feeling our decision to have a destination wedding. The ones who are coming are super excited though and everyone has been supportive as far as saying we should just do what makes us happy. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cadesha.benson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.61.107.139","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453544302,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286018.jpg?_r=1459635518","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Endreece","Id":286018,"Name":"Endreece","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"203.122.4.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80154,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ca531e83ee97d427d9aca6879b8c559","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Actually i get a mixed reaction my father and elder brother says yes to cruise wedding but my mother and younger sister suggest me to have a &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.dreamweddingshawaii.com\/&#039;&gt;beach like wedding&lt;\/a&gt;.. And after discussing on both ideas i get confused too...because both are great ideas..&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914917,"PostDate":1468904734,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Actually i get a mixed reaction my father and elder brother says yes to cruise wedding but my mother and younger sister suggest me to have a <a href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingshawaii.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>beach like wedding<\/a>.. And after discussing on both ideas i get confused too...because both are great ideas..\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelaczmiel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"203.122.4.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1468903240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287387.jpg?_r=1469776593","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":177,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AngelaCzmiel","Id":287387,"Name":"AngelaCzmiel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.26.162.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80154,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8aff1459246c5be238a651f3bcad7e3c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@GrahamCrackerLackin- Welcome to the boards! I got married in Jamaica during a cruise on Royal Caribbean in April 2016. There is definitely pros and cons to a cruise wedding, but we would do it again without hesitation!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There is still a lot of planning and work that goes into a cruise wedding. We did the ceremony in Jamaica and used a Jamaican wedding coordinator. I was happy with this decision because it allowed me to work with her to plan the ceremony for the year prior. This is compared to working with a random person in the wedding department of the cruise line prior to the cruise and not being able to do much planning until the month or two prior to the cruise, then working with a different person once you get on the cruise.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As far as guest reactions, we had an overall good response. Most people who didn&#039;t come would not have come to a destination wedding in Mexico due to not having the finances or able to take off enough time. The only difference the cruise made for us was that women could not be more than 24 weeks pregnant. This rule caused at least 3 couples to back out because they would be too far in the pregnancy. If we had done a destination wedding, they could have come, although they still might not have felt comfortable traveling that late in their pregnancy.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:small;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Here is a link to my planning thread, which might be helpful: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79586-cruisebride2016-cruise-wedding-planning-thread\/#entry1904615&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79586-cruisebride2016-cruise-wedding-planning-thread\/#entry1904615&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:small;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:small;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Feel free to send me any questions you have about planning a cruise wedding. Good luck!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914956,"PostDate":1469055461,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@GrahamCrackerLackin- Welcome to the boards! I got married in Jamaica during a cruise on Royal Caribbean in April 2016. There is definitely pros and cons to a cruise wedding, but we would do it again without hesitation!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There is still a lot of planning and work that goes into a cruise wedding. We did the ceremony in Jamaica and used a Jamaican wedding coordinator. I was happy with this decision because it allowed me to work with her to plan the ceremony for the year prior. This is compared to working with a random person in the wedding department of the cruise line prior to the cruise and not being able to do much planning until the month or two prior to the cruise, then working with a different person once you get on the cruise.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As far as guest reactions, we had an overall good response. Most people who didn't come would not have come to a destination wedding in Mexico due to not having the finances or able to take off enough time. The only difference the cruise made for us was that women could not be more than 24 weeks pregnant. This rule caused at least 3 couples to back out because they would be too far in the pregnancy. If we had done a destination wedding, they could have come, although they still might not have felt comfortable traveling that late in their pregnancy.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:small\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Here is a link to my planning thread, which might be helpful: <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79586-cruisebride2016-cruise-wedding-planning-thread\/#entry1904615' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...d\/#entry1904615<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:small\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:small\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Feel free to send me any questions you have about planning a cruise wedding. Good luck!<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10743;484\/st\/20160413\/e\/Wedding+Day\/k\/c760\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"lm_sprowl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.26.164.62","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418257431,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cruisebride2016","Id":281378,"Name":"cruisebride2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80154","Title":"Cruise Wedding Reactions?","LastPostDate":1469055461},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
