{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":1,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":452,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1914609,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":287268,"Name":"Rostele425","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1467360858,"LastPoster":{"Id":287268,"Name":"Rostele425","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":88,"Preview":{"Id":1914609,"PostDate":1467360858,"PostContent":"Hey all! I really wanted to know more about cruise weddings. I've always wanted to have a cruise...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rosspete24@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.186.141.92","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1467247011,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Rostele425","Id":287268,"Name":"Rostele425","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"111.93.103.197","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80159,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93a065eda962ca0ab6c1f38ea25326db","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey all! I really wanted to know more about cruise weddings. I&#039;ve always wanted to have a cruise wedding and my fiancee too loves to travel and is so much a sea person. So, I wanted to know on how this could be done. We are planning our wedding this year August. I&#039;ve f&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.blountsmallshipadventures.com\/cruises\/magical-lake-michigan\/&#039;&gt;ound out that there&#039;s a small ship cruise trip to Michigan Island, this August too&lt;\/a&gt;. So, is it, in anyway possible to get married in this cruise ship? How do you otherwise organize such weddings? &amp;nbsp;Would really like to know.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914609,"PostDate":1467360858,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey all! I really wanted to know more about cruise weddings. I've always wanted to have a cruise wedding and my fiancee too loves to travel and is so much a sea person. So, I wanted to know on how this could be done. We are planning our wedding this year August. I've f<a href='https:\/\/www.blountsmallshipadventures.com\/cruises\/magical-lake-michigan\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>ound out that there's a small ship cruise trip to Michigan Island, this August too<\/a>. So, is it, in anyway possible to get married in this cruise ship? How do you otherwise organize such weddings? \u00a0Would really like to know.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rosspete24@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.186.141.92","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1467247011,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Rostele425","Id":287268,"Name":"Rostele425","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80159","Title":"In Love With Cruise Weddings.","LastPostDate":1467360858},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
